     A*  D0426Q - PROBE ONLY (not shipped). Same as D0426A, plus one
     A*  constant conditioned by indicator 50 (customer not found).
     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
     A          R INQFMT
     A                                      CF03(03)
     A                                  1  2'Customer code:'
     A            TOKCD          6A  I  1 17
     A                                  3  2'Name:'
     A            TOKNM         30A  O  3  8
     A  50                              5  2'Not found'
     A                                  7  2'F3=Exit'
